WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.150
She said "I'm fine"

2
00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:02.650
214 times in one year.

3
00:00:02.950 --> 00:00:04.100
Her sister kept count

4
00:00:04.150 --> 00:00:05.600
on a yellow sticky note.

5
00:00:06.250 --> 00:00:07.700
The tally started the week

6
00:00:07.750 --> 00:00:09.800
she got passed over for a promotion.

7
00:00:10.100 --> 00:00:11.550
Each "I'm fine" came with

8
00:00:11.600 --> 00:00:12.450
the same smile

9
00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:14.250
and the same quick subject change.

10
00:00:14.550 --> 00:00:16.600
The sticky note sat on the fridge,

11
00:00:16.650 --> 00:00:18.700
and she never once looked at it.

12
00:00:19.350 --> 00:00:20.800
Her sister wasn't counting lies.

13
00:00:21.100 --> 00:00:22.550
She was counting every chance

14
00:00:22.600 --> 00:00:23.450
to ask again.

15
00:00:24.100 --> 00:00:24.950
At tally 20,

16
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:26.150
her sister asked once,

17
00:00:26.200 --> 00:00:27.050
then dropped it.

18
00:00:27.350 --> 00:00:28.200
At tally 80,

19
00:00:28.250 --> 00:00:29.100
she stopped asking

20
00:00:29.150 --> 00:00:30.600
in front of the family.

21
00:00:30.900 --> 00:00:31.750
At tally 150,

22
00:00:31.800 --> 00:00:32.950
she wrote a letter

23
00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:34.150
and never sent it.

24
00:00:34.450 --> 00:00:35.300
At tally 214,

25
00:00:35.350 --> 00:00:37.400
she pulled the note off the fridge

26
00:00:37.450 --> 00:00:39.200
and put it on the table.

27
00:00:39.850 --> 00:00:42.200
"I'm fine" is a door you close politely,

28
00:00:42.250 --> 00:00:43.400
and people stop knocking.

29
00:00:43.700 --> 00:00:44.550
Try this instead:

30
00:00:44.600 --> 00:00:45.750
"I'm not okay yet,

31
00:00:45.800 --> 00:00:47.250
but I'm working on it."

32
00:00:47.900 --> 00:00:48.750
I'm Dimples.

33
00:00:48.800 --> 00:00:50.850
I talk about the things we feel

34
00:00:50.900 --> 00:00:52.350
but never say out loud.

35
00:00:52.400 --> 00:00:53.250
Follow for more.
